      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We report two cases of giant hemangioma of the liver revealed by a clinico-biological syndrome including fever, right upper quadrant pain and a biological inflammatory syndrome, whereas liver function tests and blood cell count were normal. This clinical presentation may help in the diagnosis of giant hemangioma of the liver."},
